exports[`Iteration learning prompt snapshot iteration learning section matches snapshot: iteration-learning 1`] = `
"
---

## Lessons from Previous Iteration (iteration 3)

The following issues were identified in the previous review. You MUST address all of them in this iteration. Do NOT repeat these mistakes:

1. **[MINOR]** Missing unit tests
   Auth module needs tests
2. **[MAJOR]** Wrong API design
3. **[ESCALATE]** Security vulnerability
   SQL injection in query builder

**Priority:** Fix the highest-severity issues first (ESCALATE > MAJOR > MINOR).
"
`;

